@bank all
// Pillar 5 (head writer, seat W): what you see on your rounds (M1, 24a's roundSign). TEXTS. sign.<kind>.<state>,
// state healthy / worn / faulty (faulty means faulty or worse). A few per state; 24a picks one by the day.
// Kinds: the Tier 1 ten, plus scrubber and heater for rounds that pass them. Plain words, a few at a time.

== sign.washer.healthy
- Drum turns clean and quiet.
- A smooth spin. No drips.
- Dry floor, quiet drum.
== sign.washer.worn
- A faint rattle at the end of the spin.
- The door seal looks a little tired.
- A damp patch by the pump. Just a damp patch.
== sign.washer.faulty
- Water pooling under it.
- It thumps on the spin and walks across the floor.
- It stops halfway and clicks.

== sign.oven.healthy
- Even heat, door seal snug.
- Warms up quickly and evenly.
- A steady glow behind the glass.
== sign.oven.worn
- The door seal's a bit tired.
- Slow to warm up this morning.
- A squeal from the fan, then quiet.
== sign.oven.faulty
- Hot one side, cool the other.
- Barely warm after ten minutes.
- The glow stutters.

== sign.range.healthy
- Every ring heats evenly.
- Clean rings, quick heat.
- Clicks once, heats at once.
== sign.range.worn
- One ring's a touch slow.
- A click, a pause, then heat.
- A ring's edge is darker than the rest.
== sign.range.faulty
- One ring stays cold.
- It clicks and clicks. No heat.
- Every ring too fierce.

== sign.galleyplant.healthy
- A low, steady draw.
- The grille's clean. The fan's quiet.
- Air moving nicely.
== sign.galleyplant.worn
- A faint squeal as it starts.
- A film of grease on the grille.
- The belt looks shiny.
== sign.galleyplant.faulty
- Barely drawing. The air's thick.
- A grinding hum.
- Grease dripping off the grille.

== sign.extractor.healthy
- The hood draws clean.
- Smoke goes straight up and out.
- Quiet and steady.
== sign.extractor.worn
- A squeal at start, then fine.
- The hood's filter is darkening.
- Smoke hangs a moment too long.
== sign.extractor.faulty
- Smoke lingers over the hob.
- It runs, stops, runs again.
- Grease dripping at the hood's edge.

== sign.chiller.healthy
- Cold and quiet. A soft hum.
- Door shuts with a good seal.
- Frost-free and steady.
== sign.chiller.worn
- A little frost round the door frame.
- The hum runs a bit long.
- The back shelf's not as cold as the front.
== sign.chiller.faulty
- Warm inside. The milk won't last.
- A laboured hum that never stops.
- A rattle from the back.

== sign.lift.healthy
- Smooth between decks.
- Doors open on time.
- A quiet ride.
== sign.lift.worn
- A short pause before the doors open.
- A faint grinding between decks.
- It hesitates at Four.
== sign.lift.faulty
- It judders between decks.
- It stalls at the doors.
- The breaker light's on.

== sign.lights.healthy
- Steady light.
- Every lamp bright and even.
- Quiet in the box.
== sign.lights.worn
- A click now and then in the box.
- One lamp's a touch dim.
- A slight flicker after a while.
== sign.lights.faulty
- The lights stutter.
- A whole run's dark.
- Flickers every time the door slams.

== sign.cartdock.healthy
- The lamp holds steady. Charging.
- The cart's gauge climbs nicely.
- Plug in, lamp on. Good.
== sign.cartdock.worn
- The lamp blinks before it holds.
- The gauge is slow to climb.
- The cable's worn near the plug.
== sign.cartdock.faulty
- It won't charge at all.
- Stuck at three quarters.
- Only charges if you jiggle the plug.

== sign.growlight.healthy
- A rack of bright pink lamps.
- Even light along the rack.
- Warm and bright.
== sign.growlight.worn
- One lamp in the row is pale.
- The rack blinks once, then holds.
- A lamp at the end looks tired.
== sign.growlight.faulty
- A whole row gone pale.
- The rack keeps cutting out.
- Lit at the wrong hour.

== sign.scrubber.healthy
- A low, even hum.
- The air smells clean.
- The grille is clear.
== sign.scrubber.worn
- The hum's a touch higher than it should be.
- The grille's going grey.
- A faint whine under the hum.
== sign.scrubber.faulty
- It's labouring. The air's stale near it.
- A loud whine.
- The grille's thick with grey.

== sign.heater.healthy
- Warm and quiet.
- The pipes are warm along their length.
- A gentle tick as it runs.
== sign.heater.worn
- One branch is cooler than the rest.
- A knock now and then.
- It clicks off and on.
== sign.heater.faulty
- Cold pipes. Cold cabins.
- A steady knocking.
- Off, on, off, on.
